{"id":"b2e63b755a37f1dc","group":"58","path":"58/batch17/58-df-continuous-function.md","title":"Continuous Function","display":"df-continuous-function — Continuous Function","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-continuous-function","aliases":["58-df-continuous-function"],"display":"df-continuous-function — Continuous Function","depends_on":["[[../batch12/58-df-topological-space.md]]","[[../batch16/58-df-function.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-continuous-function"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-continuous-function</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-continuous-function — Continuous Function"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"815e63e5071e7b58\" href=\"?note=815e63e5071e7b58\" title=\"../batch12/58-df-topological-space.md\">../batch12/58-df-topological-space.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"36d7463d215be751\" href=\"?note=36d7463d215be751\" title=\"../batch16/58-df-function.md\">../batch16/58-df-function.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"X,Y,\\tau_X,\\tau_Y,f\\in V\">\\(X,Y,\\tau_X,\\tau_Y,f\\in V\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{TopologicalSpace}_S\">\\(\\operatorname{TopologicalSpace}_S\\)</span>（拓扑空间谓词，见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"815e63e5071e7b58\" href=\"?note=815e63e5071e7b58\" title=\"../batch12/58-df-topological-space.md\">../batch12/58-df-topological-space.md</a>）</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"f\\in Y^X\">\\(f\\in Y^X\\)</span>（函数，见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"36d7463d215be751\" href=\"?note=36d7463d215be751\" title=\"../batch16/58-df-function.md\">../batch16/58-df-function.md</a>）</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"f^{-1}[U]\\coloneqq\\{x\\in X:f(x)\\in U\\}\">\\(f^{-1}[U]\\coloneqq\\{x\\in X:f(x)\\in U\\}\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ContinuousFunction}_S\\subseteq V^5\">\\(\\mathrm{ContinuousFunction}_S\\subseteq V^5\\)</span>（此处定义的连续函数谓词）</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}continuous\\text{-}function} \\vdash \\mathrm{ContinuousFunction}_S(f,X,\\tau_X,Y,\\tau_Y)\\leftrightarrow\\operatorname{TopologicalSpace}_S(X,\\tau_X)\\land\\operatorname{TopologicalSpace}_S(Y,\\tau_Y)\\land f\\in Y^X\\land\\forall U\\in\\tau_Y\\;(f^{-1}[U]\\in\\tau_X)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}continuous\\text{-}function} \\vdash \\mathrm{ContinuousFunction}_S(f,X,\\tau_X,Y,\\tau_Y)\\leftrightarrow\\operatorname{TopologicalSpace}_S(X,\\tau_X)\\land\\operatorname{TopologicalSpace}_S(Y,\\tau_Y)\\land f\\in Y^X\\land\\forall U\\in\\tau_Y\\;(f^{-1}[U]\\in\\tau_X)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>This is the inverse-image definition of continuity.</li>\n<li>把两端拓扑纳入谓词参数，避免同一底集上的不同拓扑被隐式混同。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"../batch12/58-df-topological-space.md","status":"resolved","id":"815e63e5071e7b58","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch12/58-df-topological-space.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch16/58-df-function.md","status":"resolved","id":"36d7463d215be751","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","e