ction}_S(\\phi,A,\\tau_A,X,\\tau_X)$ (see [[../batch17/58-df-continuous-function.md]])"},{"id":"2d699a9437790a33","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{ContinuousFunction}_S$ (continuous-function predicate, see [[../batch17/58-df-continuous-function.md]])"},{"id":"77058c5482c65c5c","anchor":"ref-8","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Compact}_S\\subseteq V^2$ and $\\mathrm{ContinuousFunction}_S\\subseteq V^5$ (see [[../batch05/58-df-compact.md]], [[../batch17/58-df-continuous-function.md]])."},{"id":"503d015c67c34259","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"bb62713ade4dcadf","anchor":"ref-11","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"外部接口 $\\mathrm{ContinuousFunction}$ 取 [[58-df-continuous-function]] 的同名定义与参数次序。"},{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-357","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch17/58-df-continuous-function.md|58-df-continuous-function]]（batch17）"}],"outgoing":["815e63e5071e7b58","36d7463d215be751"]}